Z||000000||BENGAL4||07-22-2001||09:47 PM||||Stopped by 87EC05's house last night and our good freind Boilermaker was there. He wanted a ride in my GT, so I said lets go. We pull up to a stoplight and the was a girlin a 5.0 Mustang GT. I had no thoghts of racing her, but when she took off, I couldn't resist. She had a car's length lead on me, until I hit second gear. After that she was toast. My GT has so much low end torque, it is unreal. I love it when they think it is just a Fiero, and then they get their ass handed to them. Can you say SLEEPER.<P>Bill<BR>86GT<BR>3800 Series II S/C<BR> ||||reg||10
