Z||000010||NOS3800||07-22-2001||11:59 PM||||In my experience(go to track every Friday) most STOCK 90's mustangs run high to low 15's. With minor mods many run mid 14's. Rarely do you see a 13 sec Mustang. The new ones run mid to low 14's. <BR>My bro's 3800 SC Fiero coupe runs 13.3's to 13.6's. Mustangs are quick, believe me, but they aren't the fastest thing on the street anymore.<P><P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.58@99.08 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph||||reg||12
