Z||000029||banditbalz||07-25-2001||10:48 PM||||Sorry to rain on everyones Mustang parade again, but I spanked another Mustang tonight. It was a beautiful lowered, white,  86 or later hatchback with a 5.0L and a 5 speed tranny. It was a full out race as we both gave the customary engine rev. I wasn't sure if the guy was serious, so I waited for the 5.0L engine moan. Yep, it's a race. pull redline in first and I am already a car length on him. Catch a nice, tight chirp in second and I have a couple of car lenths on him. By third gear, I figured he had just given up. Funny thing is, that is where the Mustang would eat me up.<BR>I have driven a number of 5.0's and have first hand experience of their potential, but I have been fortunate enough to never have lost a race against one on the street. At the track, I have far more losses to Mustangs than wins. <BR>_<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/HardLaunch_3.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||14
